["en","Sweet are the uses of adversity.","逆境自有它甜美的用處。","William Shakespeare（莎士比亞）《皆大歡喜》","英國"],
["en","Come what come may, time and the hour runs through the roughest day.","不管發生什麼，時間總會走過最艱難的一天。","William Shakespeare（莎士比亞）《馬克白》","英國"],
["en","There is a tide in the affairs of men, which, taken at the flood, leads on to fortune.","人生的事務有潮汐，趁著漲潮出發，便能通往好運。","William Shakespeare（莎士比亞）《凱撒大帝》","英國"],
["en","Love looks not with the eyes, but with the mind.","愛不是用眼睛看，而是用心看。","William Shakespeare（莎士比亞）《仲夏夜之夢》","英國"],
["en","There is nothing like staying at home for real comfort.","要真正舒服，沒有什麼比待在家更好。","Jane Austen（珍・奧斯汀）《艾瑪》","英國"],
["en","I declare after all there is no enjoyment like reading!","說到底，沒有什麼樂趣比得上閱讀！","Jane Austen（珍・奧斯汀）《傲慢與偏見》","英國"],
["en","Have a heart that never hardens, and a temper that never tires, and a touch that never hurts.","擁有一顆永不僵硬的心、永不厭倦的脾氣，和永不傷人的觸碰。","Charles Dickens（狄更斯）","英國"],
["en","Reflect upon your present blessings, of which every man has many.","想想你眼前擁有的福氣，每個人都有很多。","Charles Dickens（狄更斯）","英國"],
["en","Begin at the beginning, and go on till you come to the end: then stop.","從開頭開始，一直做到結尾，然後停下來。","Lewis Carroll（路易斯・卡羅）《愛麗絲夢遊仙境》","英國"],
["en","It's no use going back to yesterday, because I was a different person then.","回到昨天沒有用，因為那時的我是另一個人。","Lewis Carroll（路易斯・卡羅）《愛麗絲夢遊仙境》","英國"],
["en","It's the job that's never started as takes longest to finish.","最久才完成的工作，是那件從沒開始的工作。","J. R. R. Tolkien（托爾金）《魔戒》","英國"],
["en","Some day you will be old enough to start reading fairy tales again.","有一天，你會長大到可以重新讀童話。","C. S. Lewis（路易斯）《獅子・女巫・魔衣櫥》","英國"],
["en","Two roads diverged in a wood, and I took the one less traveled by, and that has made all the difference.","樹林裡分出兩條路，我選了人跡較少的那條，一切因此不同。","Robert Frost（佛洛斯特）《未選擇的路》","美國"],
["en","Nothing gold can stay.","美好的事物都無法久留。","Robert Frost（佛洛斯特）","美國"],
["en","The woods are lovely, dark and deep, but I have promises to keep, and miles to go before I sleep.","樹林美麗、幽暗又深邃，但我還有承諾要遵守，睡前還有好幾哩路要走。","Robert Frost（佛洛斯特）","美國"],
["en","Do anything, but let it produce joy.","做什麼都好，但要讓它帶來喜悅。","Walt Whitman（惠特曼）","美國"],
["en","I am large, I contain multitudes.","我很遼闊，我包含萬千。","Walt Whitman（惠特曼）《自我之歌》","美國"],
["en","I dwell in Possibility.","我住在「可能」裡。","Emily Dickinson（艾蜜莉・狄金生）","美國"],
["en","That it will never come again is what makes life so sweet.","正因為不會再來，生命才如此甜美。","Emily Dickinson（艾蜜莉・狄金生）","美國"],
["en","Into each life some rain must fall.","每個人的生命裡，都會下一點雨。","Henry Wadsworth Longfellow（朗費羅）","美國"],
["en","Lives of great men all remind us we can make our lives sublime.","偉人的一生都提醒我們，我們也能活得崇高。","Henry Wadsworth Longfellow（朗費羅）《人生頌》","美國"],
["en","I am a part of all that I have met.","我是我所遇見的一切的一部分。","Alfred Tennyson（丁尼生）《尤利西斯》","英國"],
["en","Nothing ever becomes real till it is experienced.","沒有親身經歷過，什麼都不算真的。","John Keats（濟慈）","英國"],
["en","Come forth into the light of things, let Nature be your teacher.","走出來，走進萬物的光裡，讓大自然當你的老師。","William Wordsworth（華茲華斯）","英國"],
["en","The best portion of a good man's life: his little, nameless, unremembered acts of kindness and of love.","好人一生中最美好的部分，是那些微小、無名、沒人記得的善意與愛。","William Wordsworth（華茲華斯）","英國"],
["en","The busy bee has no time for sorrow.","忙碌的蜜蜂沒有時間悲傷。","William Blake（布萊克）","英國"],
["en","Great things are done when men and mountains meet.","人與山相遇時，偉大的事就成了。","William Blake（布萊克）","英國"],
["en","If Winter comes, can Spring be far behind?","冬天來了，春天還會遠嗎？","Percy Bysshe Shelley（雪萊）《西風頌》","英國"],
["en","Hope springs eternal in the human breast.","希望永遠在人的心中湧現。","Alexander Pope（波普）","英國"],
["en","Great works are performed not by strength but by perseverance.","偉大的工作不是靠力量完成，而是靠毅力。","Samuel Johnson（約翰生）","英國"],
["en","Self-confidence is the first requisite to great undertakings.","自信是成就大事的第一個條件。","Samuel Johnson（約翰生）","英國"],
["en","Experience is the name everyone gives to their mistakes.","經驗，是每個人給自己的錯誤取的名字。","Oscar Wilde（王爾德）","愛爾蘭"],
["en","To love oneself is the beginning of a lifelong romance.","愛自己，是一段終生浪漫的開始。","Oscar Wilde（王爾德）","愛爾蘭"],
["en","Progress is impossible without change, and those who cannot change their minds cannot change anything.","沒有改變就沒有進步；無法改變想法的人，什麼也改變不了。","George Bernard Shaw（蕭伯納）","愛爾蘭"],
["en","The best and most beautiful things in the world cannot be seen or even touched; they must be felt with the heart.","世上最好、最美的東西，看不見也摸不著，只能用心感受。","Helen Keller（海倫・凱勒）","美國"],
["en","Although the world is full of suffering, it is also full of the overcoming of it.","雖然世界充滿苦難，但也充滿了對苦難的克服。","Helen Keller（海倫・凱勒）","美國"],
["en","Far and away the best prize that life offers is the chance to work hard at work worth doing.","人生最好的獎賞，是有機會努力做一件值得做的事。","Theodore Roosevelt（老羅斯福）","美國"],
["en","Change is the law of life.","改變是生命的法則。","John F. Kennedy（甘迺迪）","美國"],
["en","Darkness cannot drive out darkness; only light can do that.","黑暗無法驅散黑暗，只有光可以。","Martin Luther King Jr.（馬丁・路德・金恩）","美國"],
["en","Everybody can be great, because anybody can serve.","每個人都能偉大，因為每個人都能服務他人。","Martin Luther King Jr.（馬丁・路德・金恩）","美國"],
["en","We may encounter many defeats, but we must not be defeated.","我們可能遭遇許多失敗，但絕不能被打敗。","Maya Angelou（瑪雅・安傑洛）","美國"],
["en","Instructions for living a life: Pay attention. Be astonished. Tell about it.","生活的指南：專注。驚嘆。說出來。","Mary Oliver（瑪麗・奧利弗）","美國"],
["en","Attention is the beginning of devotion.","專注，是投入的開始。","Mary Oliver（瑪麗・奧利弗）","美國"],
["en","A schedule defends from chaos and whim.","時間表能保護我們，免於混亂與一時興起。","Annie Dillard（安妮・迪勒）《寫作生涯》","美國"],
["en","Arrange whatever pieces come your way.","把來到你身邊的每一片，好好安放。","Virginia Woolf（吳爾芙）","英國"],
["en","Keep close to Nature's heart, and break clear away, once in a while, and climb a mountain.","靠近大自然的心，偶爾掙脫一切，去爬一座山。","John Muir（約翰・繆爾）","美國"],
["en","There is no substitute for hard work.","努力，沒有替代品。","Thomas Edison（愛迪生）","美國"],
["en","Imagination is more important than knowledge.","想像力比知識更重要。","Albert Einstein（愛因斯坦）","美國"],
["en","I learned very early the difference between knowing the name of something and knowing something.","我很早就明白，知道一樣東西的名字，和真正了解它，是兩回事。","Richard Feynman（費曼）","美國"],
["en","We are a way for the cosmos to know itself.","我們是宇宙認識自己的一種方式。","Carl Sagan（卡爾・薩根）《宇宙》","美國"],
["en","Truth is ever to be found in simplicity, and not in the multiplicity and confusion of things.","真理總在簡單之中，而不在繁雜與混亂裡。","Isaac Newton（牛頓）","英國"],
["en","Efficiency is doing things right; effectiveness is doing the right things.","效率是把事情做對，效能是做對的事情。","Peter Drucker（彼得・杜拉克）","美國"],
["en","Begin with the end in mind.","以終為始。","Stephen Covey（史蒂芬・柯維）《與成功有約》","美國"],
["en","Good is the enemy of great.","「好」是「卓越」的敵人。","Jim Collins（詹姆・柯林斯）《從A到A+》","美國"],
["en","Focusing is about saying no.","專注，就是懂得說不。","Steve Jobs（賈伯斯）","美國"],
["en","The only way to do great work is to love what you do.","做出偉大工作的唯一方法，是熱愛你做的事。","Steve Jobs（賈伯斯）","美國"],
["en","Someone's sitting in the shade today because someone planted a tree a long time ago.","今天有人坐在樹蔭下，是因為很久以前有人種了一棵樹。","Warren Buffett（巴菲特）","美國"],
["en","I've failed over and over and over again in my life. And that is why I succeed.","我這一生失敗了一次又一次，這正是我成功的原因。","Michael Jordan（麥可・喬丹）","美國"],
["en","Absorb what is useful, discard what is useless, and add what is specifically your own.","吸收有用的，丟掉無用的，再加上專屬於你自己的。","Bruce Lee（李小龍）","香港／美國"],
["en","It is our choices that show what we truly are, far more than our abilities.","能顯示我們真正是誰的，是我們的選擇，遠勝過我們的能力。","J. K. Rowling（羅琳）《哈利波特》","英國"],
["en","It does not do to dwell on dreams and forget to live.","沉溺在夢裡而忘了生活，是不行的。","J. K. Rowling（羅琳）《哈利波特》","英國"],
["en","Work is love made visible.","工作，是看得見的愛。","Kahlil Gibran（紀伯倫）《先知》","黎巴嫩"],
["en","The butterfly counts not months but moments, and has time enough.","蝴蝶不數月份，只數片刻，所以時間總是足夠。","Rabindranath Tagore（泰戈爾）","印度"],
["en","Faith is the bird that feels the light and sings when the dawn is still dark.","信念是一隻鳥，在黎明還暗時就感覺到光，開始歌唱。","Rabindranath Tagore（泰戈爾）","印度"],
["en","Clouds come floating into my life, no longer to carry rain or usher storm, but to add color to my sunset sky.","雲飄進我的生命，不再帶來雨或風暴，而是為我的夕陽天空增添色彩。","Rabindranath Tagore（泰戈爾）《漂鳥集》","印度"],
["en","One child, one teacher, one book, one pen can change the world.","一個孩子、一位老師、一本書、一枝筆，就能改變世界。","Malala Yousafzai（馬拉拉）","巴基斯坦"],
["en","Action may not always bring happiness, but there is no happiness without action.","行動不一定帶來幸福，但沒有行動就沒有幸福。","Benjamin Disraeli（迪斯雷利）","英國"],
["en","Act as if what you do makes a difference. It does.","去做吧，就當你做的事會帶來改變。它真的會。","William James（威廉・詹姆斯）","美國"],
["en","Experience is not what happens to a man; it is what a man does with what happens to him.","經驗不是發生在你身上的事，而是你如何面對那些事。","Aldous Huxley（赫胥黎）","英國"],
["en","Blessed is he who has found his work; let him ask no other blessedness.","找到自己工作的人是有福的，他不必再求別的福氣。","Thomas Carlyle（卡萊爾）","蘇格蘭"],
["en","There is no wealth but life.","除了生命，沒有其他財富。","John Ruskin（羅斯金）","英國"],
["en","There is really no such thing as bad weather, only different kinds of good weather.","其實沒有壞天氣，只有不同種類的好天氣。","John Ruskin（羅斯金）","英國"],
["en","The strongest principle of growth lies in human choice.","成長最強大的原理，在於人的選擇。","George Eliot（喬治・艾略特）","英國"],
["en","Only connect.","只要連結。","E. M. Forster（佛斯特）《此情可問天》","英國"],
["en","Courage is grace under pressure.","勇氣，是在壓力下依然從容。","Ernest Hemingway（海明威）","美國"],
["en","In the beginner's mind there are many possibilities, but in the expert's there are few.","初學者的心裡有許多可能，專家的心裡卻很少。","Shunryu Suzuki（鈴木俊隆）《禪者的初心》","日本／美國"],
["en","Walk as if you are kissing the Earth with your feet.","走路的時候，就像用你的腳親吻大地。","Thich Nhat Hanh（一行禪師）","越南"],
["en","You have brains in your head. You have feet in your shoes. You can steer yourself any direction you choose.","你腦袋裡有頭腦，鞋子裡有雙腳，你可以朝任何你選的方向前進。","Dr. Seuss（蘇斯博士）","美國"],
["en","Today you are You, that is truer than true.","今天的你就是你，這比真的還要真。","Dr. Seuss（蘇斯博士）","美國"],
["en","Those who don't believe in magic will never find it.","不相信魔法的人，永遠找不到它。","Roald Dahl（羅德・達爾）","英國"],
["en","Look for the helpers. You will always find people who are helping.","去找那些幫忙的人，你一定會找到正在幫助別人的人。","Fred Rogers（羅傑斯先生）","美國"],
["en","Example is not the main thing in influencing others. It is the only thing.","影響別人，以身作則不是主要的方法，而是唯一的方法。","Albert Schweitzer（史懷哲）","法國／德國"],
["en","Many hands make light work.","人多好辦事。","英語諺語","英國"],
["en","Every cloud has a silver lining.","每朵烏雲都鑲著銀邊。","英語諺語","英國"],
["en","Better late than never.","遲做總比不做好。","英語諺語","英國"],
["en","Actions speak louder than words.","行動勝於言語。","英語諺語","英國"],
["en","An apple a day keeps the doctor away.","一天一顆蘋果，醫生遠離我。","英語諺語","英國"],
["en","After all, tomorrow is another day.","畢竟，明天又是新的一天。","Margaret Mitchell（瑪格麗特・米契爾）《飄》","美國"],
["en","The pen is mightier than the sword.","筆比劍更有力量。","Edward Bulwer-Lytton（布爾沃－利頓）","英國"],
["en","Patience is a virtue.","耐心是一種美德。","英語諺語","英國"],
["en","Laughter is the best medicine.","笑是最好的良藥。","英語諺語","英國"],
["en","Where there's a will, there's a way.","有志者，事竟成。","英語諺語","英國"],
["en","Do not wait to strike till the iron is hot; but make it hot by striking.","別等鐵熱了才打，要邊打邊讓它變熱。","William Butler Yeats（葉慈）","愛爾蘭"],
["en","Ask not what your country can do for you; ask what you can do for your country.","不要問國家能為你做什麼，要問你能為國家做什麼。","John F. Kennedy（甘迺迪）","美國"],
["en","The secret of change is to focus all of your energy not on fighting the old, but on building the new.","改變的祕訣，是把所有力氣用來建立新的，而不是對抗舊的。","Dan Millman（丹・米爾曼）《深夜加油站遇見蘇格拉底》","美國"],
["en","The more that you read, the more things you will know. The more that you learn, the more places you'll go.","讀得越多，知道得越多；學得越多，去的地方越多。","Dr. Seuss（蘇斯博士）","美國"],
["en","Rest is not idleness.","休息不是懶散。","John Lubbock（約翰・盧伯克）","英國"],
["en","Rest when you're weary. Refresh and renew yourself, your body, your mind, your spirit. Then get back to work.","累了就休息，讓身體、頭腦與心靈重新充電，然後再回去工作。","Ralph Marston（雷夫・馬斯頓）","美國"],
["en","Almost everything will work again if you unplug it for a few minutes, including you.","幾乎任何東西拔掉插頭幾分鐘後都會重新運作，包括你。","Anne Lamott（安・拉莫特）","美國"],
["en","Small deeds done are better than great deeds planned.","做完的小事，勝過計畫中的大事。","Peter Marshall（彼得・馬歇爾）","美國"],
["en","The days are long, but the years are short.","日子很長，年歲卻很短。","Gretchen Rubin（葛瑞琴・魯賓）","美國"],
["en","What gets scheduled gets done.","排進行程的事，才會被完成。","英語職場格言","美國"]
